---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import AffiliateBanner from '../components/AffiliateBanner.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact"
  description="Get in touch with GenAIPick. Send suggestions, feedback, or just say hello."
>
  <div class="static-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="static-content">
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        
        <p>Have a question, suggestion, or just want to chat about AI tools? I'd love to hear from you.</p>

        <p>GenAIPick is run by one person: <a href="/author/">Lao Lu</a>. No support team, no ticket queue &mdash; you are writing directly to the person who tests and reviews the tools.</p>
        
        <h2>What I Can Help With</h2>
        
        <ul>
          <li>Tool review requests and suggestions</li>
          <li>Corrections or updates to existing articles</li>
          <li>General questions about AI tools</li>
          <li>Collaboration opportunities</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>What I Probably Can't Help With</h2>
        
        <ul>
          <li>Personal AI implementation advice (I don't have capacity for consulting)</li>
          <li>Guest posting requests (my content stays authentic)</li>
          <li>Spam</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>How to Reach Me</h2>
        
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:hello@genaipick.com">hello@genaipick.com</a></li>
          <li><strong>Telegram:</strong> <a href="https://t.me/ulysis6" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">@ulysis6</a> (fastest)</li>
          <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/shenlu-ulysis6/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">shenlu-ulysis6</a></li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>I try to respond to all legitimate messages within a few days. If something is time-sensitive, Telegram is your best bet.</p>
        
        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        
        <p><strong>Do you accept guest posts?</strong> No. My content stays authentic and hands-on.</p>
        <p><strong>Do you charge for reviews?</strong> No. I pay for my own subscriptions and never accept payment for coverage.</p>
        <p><strong>Can you help me implement AI in my business?</strong> I don't do consulting, but my <a href="/blog/">tutorials</a> cover the tools step by step.</p>
        
        <AffiliateBanner variant="compact" />
        
        <p>Thanks for reaching out!</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
